    "note": "All printed obligations pass paid rules scenarios. New attachment is required for the reflexive; its fight uses the creature currently equipped on resolution (or the source last known attachment), per Oracle and CR608.2h. XMage NovelNunchakuFightEffect captures the original entry target instead; this implementation resolves that discrepancy against equipped creature wording. Granted combat damage triggers once per simultaneous batch, for any damage recipient, and belongs to the equipped creature controller. Printed sacrifice-only equip has no mana component and is once per turn."
